  <prompt>
    Add an Add Comment toolbar affordance and wire it to the comment round-trip machinery that already shipped + seam-proven in R6
    (024/026). Only the UI entry point is missing.
  </prompt>

  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Expert in the Compose toolbar and the shipped comment round-trip path. Follow ADRs strictly.</role>

  <goal>
    An Add Comment control exists in the Compose toolbar and creates a comment via the existing shipped machinery (no new comment pipeline).
  </goal>

  <context>
    <background>
      spec.md FR-10 (R6 D7). Comment machinery shipped + seam-proven in R6 tasks 024/026; only the toolbar entry point is missing.
    </background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.Compose.Components/src/widgets/ComposeAiToolbar.tsx</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.Compose.Components/src/widgets/ComposeFormatToolbar.tsx</file>
