  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="0" name="Context + rigor declaration">Declare rigor FULL; load spec FR-10 + locate the shipped comment machinery (024/026).</step>
    <step order="1">Add an Add Comment control to the toolbar (Fluent v9 tokens).</step>
    <step order="2">Wire it to the existing comment round-trip path.</step>
    <step order="3">Add unit tests + ui-tests: the affordance creates a comment via the shipped path.</step>
